    Fix 500 error for GET /api/playlists with multi-value Accept header (#8267)
    
    Fixes #8132.
    
    Response.ok(entity, mediaType) requires a single media type, but clients
    commonly send several, e.g. the XHR default "text/plain, */*; q=0.01".
    Route through ApiResponseBuilder.Json.ok() instead, which already
    handles this via ApiMediaType.parse(), matching the other external-API
    endpoints.
    
